&lt;li&gt;Resolve urgent issues impacting businesses, carriers and consumers worldwide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Twilio’s tools and your own investigative powers to detect and prevent non-compliant activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for customers by email, to ensure customers have an excellent experience with Twilio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
